OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after toddler seriously
OL,4,Ahurt in e-bike crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has been questioned after a
OL,7,Ftwo-year-old girl was struck by an
OL,8,Felectric bike, leaving her seriously
OL,9,Finjured.
OL,11,FThe collision happened on Pathfields
OL,12,FRoad in Clacton-on-Sea, Essex, at about
OL,13,F21:00 BST on Thursday.
OL,15,FPolice said an 18-year-old man, from
OL,16,FClacton, was held on suspicion of
OL,17,Fcausing serious injury by dangerous
OL,18,Fdriving, and bailed until 10 November
OL,19,Fwhile inquiries continued.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
